OL,5,G0100 #Text Me When You Get Home
OL,6,     FIn 2006, Elizabeth Shoaf, age 14,
OL,7,     Fwas abducted near her rural home
OL,8,     Fin South Carolina. The teenager
OL,9,     Fwas missing for over a week when a
OL,10,     Ftext message came through that
OL,11,     Foffered hope.
